# kiln's patch for SkinTokens (github.com/VAST-AI-Research/SkinTokens, MIT) at commit
# 273b691d35989d71cd17ff2895fdc735097b92d1: runs on Apple Silicon (MPS) and on NVIDIA
# without flash-attn. Upstream hard-codes "cuda" as the device and autocast target, imports
# flash-attn with no fallback and asks transformers for flash_attention_2; each edit keeps
# upstream's behaviour where that holds and falls back to PyTorch's SDPA where it does not.
#
# These edits are the ones made by scripts/patch_skintokens_portable.py of image-to-3dlab
# (AssetFurnace), Copyright 2026 Bingeljell and image-to-3dlab contributors,
# https://github.com/Bingeljell/image-to-3dlab, licensed under the Apache License 2.0
# (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). Changed here: written out as one git diff
# against the pinned commit, applied by tools/autorig.py setup. See plugin/NOTICE.
#
# git apply ignores everything above the first "diff --git" line.

